{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is the first hour or so of Unattached: City of Shadows, showing some of the features of the game as well as introducing its world through its first quest. The description of the main game is as follows:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127380/extras/734fd642641561f88fa74bba42d16c3f.avif?t=1761767132\" width=1516 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city, no closet is without skeletons. You are James Arnold, a rookie detective assigned to investigate the assassination of New Eastbrook's mayor, Casey Ward, as well as the seemingly-connected deaths of police officers throughout the year of 2022. Every lead drags you deeper into a web of mob power, crooked cops, and corruption that will not yield. Savour a fully-voiced tumultuous detective story involving constant emotional, rarely clear-cut decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127380/extras/34a4713d11c37f93275d11211bec0795.avif?t=1761767132\" width=1516 height=220 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Search crime scenes for hidden evidence</strong>, from bloody weapons left behind to mobile phones of victims containing suspicious phone records.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the evidence obtained to build an idea of what happened in each crime scene, the motives behind the crime, and who committed it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interrogate suspects</strong> using a mix of sympathy, stone-cold neutrality, and raw aggression as needed to draw out the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No choice is ever clean</strong>; the paths you take in each case will reveal what type of detective you choose to be.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127380/extras/2c266de32e4de6923ace3158014c9646.avif?t=1761767132\" width=1516 height=220 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a <strong>gritty, melee-only combat</strong> using a vast array of weapons, from baseball bats to meat cleavers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight alone against the worst of the city, from thugs in a back alley to mob enforcers in a warehouse.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use a combination of timing, positioning, and bravery</strong> to defeat enemies in encounters where the odds are never in your favour.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127380/extras/b3f0802ead92c499094e50f3f6cf002f.avif?t=1761767132\" width=1516 height=220 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character, <strong>visit the various barbers and clothing shops</strong> to change your look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy houses across the city and customize their interior furniture to your liking.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tune your ride</strong>: paint jobs, seat colours, interiors, and tires; as well as a spoiler and a supercharger (which also tunes your car's engine).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in businesses</strong> that return a steady income to keep the lifestyle going.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127380/extras/e2e84e78d542b463fbde8653ebade241.avif?t=1761767132\" width=1516 height=220 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a large open world where you can also visit restaurants to refuel and pawn shops to sell whatever junk you collect along the way of your adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in side activities such as backyard brawls.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127380?t=1761767132","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127380?t=1761767132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127380/12fc37e9499e02d70a1ecee939a42c2b3549c30b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761767132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127380/12fc37e9499e02d70a1ecee939a42c2b3549c30b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761767132","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Standard mature content that is included in open world games (i.e. fights, crime etc.)\r\n\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This is the first hour or so of Unattached: City of Shadows, showing some of the features of the game as well as introducing its world through its first quest. The description of the main game is as follows:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127380/extras/734fd642641561f88fa74bba42d16c3f.avif?t=1761767132\" width=1516 height=220 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this city, no closet is without skeletons. You are James Arnold, a rookie detective assigned to investigate the assassination of New Eastbrook's mayor, Casey Ward, as well as the seemingly-connected deaths of police officers throughout the year of 2022. Every lead drags you deeper into a web of mob power, crooked cops, and corruption that will not yield. Savour a fully-voiced tumultuous detective story involving constant emotional, rarely clear-cut