t=220 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character, <strong>visit the various barbers and clothing shops</strong> to change your look.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy houses across the city and customize their interior furniture to your liking.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tune your ride</strong>: paint jobs, seat colours, interiors, and tires; as well as a spoiler and a supercharger (which also tunes your car's engine).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invest in businesses</strong> that return a steady income to keep the lifestyle going.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127380/extras/e2e84e78d542b463fbde8653ebade241.avif?t=1761767132\" width=1516 height=220 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into a large open world where you can also visit restaurants to refuel and pawn shops to sell whatever junk you collect along the way of your adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in side activities such as backyard brawls.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Fahlawa Studio FZE"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3986620","name":"Unattached: City of Shadows"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127380/4e3945a42c81162c4eed08348296faafa8a34191/header.jpg?t=1761767132","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"