.600x338.jpg?t=1761767132"}],"short_description":"Freshly-graduated detective James Arnold is sent on a mission to investigate the death of the mayor of New Eastbrook, a little-known city where corruption is tradition. Investigate crime scenes, interrogate suspects, and fight criminals in a city where every choice pulls you deeper into the shadows.","steam_appid":4127380,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://unattachedgame.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"demo","website":"https://unattachedgame.com/"}